{"seq":4,"slug":"lc0049-group-anagrams","title":"LeetCode 49 字母异位词分组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0049-group-anagrams","wordCount":913,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-49-字母异位词分组\">LeetCode 49 字母异位词分组</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个字符串数组，请你将<strong>字母异位词</strong>组合在一起。可以按任意顺序返回结果列表。</p>\n<p><strong>字母异位词</strong>是由重新排列源单词的所有字母得到的一个新单词，所有源单词中的字母通常恰好只用一次。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>strs = [&quot;eat&quot;,&quot;tea&quot;,&quot;tan&quot;,&quot;ate&quot;,&quot;nat&quot;,&quot;bat&quot;]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[[&quot;bat&quot;],[&quot;nat&quot;,&quot;tan&quot;],[&quot;ate&quot;,&quot;eat&quot;,&quot;tea&quot;]]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>strs = [&quot;&quot;]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[[&quot;&quot;]]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>strs = [&quot;a&quot;]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[[&quot;a&quot;]]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= strs.length &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= strs[i].length &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>strs[i]</code> 仅包含小写英文字母</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本题的关键在于定义「字母异位词」的等价关系：两个字符串互为字母异位词，当且仅当它们包含完全相同的字母及其出现次数。需要找到一种高效的方式将等价的字符串映射到同一个分组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"核心问题-如何确定分组键\">核心问题：如何确定分组键</h3><p>字母异位词分组的核心是找到一种「规范化」方法，使得互为异位词的字符串映射到同一个键。常见的策略有两种：</p>\n<p><strong>策略一：排序作为键。</strong> 将每个字符串的字符排序后作为哈希键。例如 <code>&quot;eat&quot;</code>、<code>&quot;tea&quot;</code>、<code>&quot;ate&quot;</code> 排序后都是 <code>&quot;aet&quot;</code>，因此被分到同一组。排序单个字符串的时间为 O(k log k)，其中 k 为字符串长度。</p>\n<p><strong>策略二：字符频次作为键。</strong> 统计每个字符串中 26 个字母各自出现的次数，将频次数组编码为字符串作为键。例如 <code>&quot;eat&quot;</code> 编码为 <code>&quot;1#0#0#0#1#...#1#0#...&quot;</code>（a=1, e=1, t=1）。构造单个键的时间为 O(k + 26) = O(k)。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>键构造时间</th>\n<th>总时间复杂度</th>\n<th>键示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>排序作为键</td>\n<td>O(k log k)</td>\n<td>O(n · k log k)</td>\n<td>&quot;aet&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频次编码键</td>\n<td>O(k)</td>\n<td>O(n · k)</td>\n<td>&quot;1#0#0#0#1#...#1&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 n 为字符串个数，k 为字符串平均长度。当字符串较短时（k ≤ 100），两种方法差异不大；当 k 较大时，频次编码更优。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么排序法更实用\">为什么排序法更实用</h3><p>虽然频次编码在理论复杂度上更优，但排序法的实现更简洁、更不容易出错。在面试中推荐排序法，除非面试官明确要求 O(nk) 的解法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-排序分组\">方法一：排序分组</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function groupAnagrams(strs: string[]): string[][] {&#10;  const map = new Map&lt;string, string[]&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const str of strs) {&#10;    const key = str.split(&#39;&#39;).sort().join(&#39;&#39;);&#10;    if (!map.has(key)) {&#10;      map.set(key, []);&#10;    }&#10;    map.get(key)!.push(str);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return Array.from(map.values());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> groupAnagrams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">strs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strs) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> str.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">map.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      map.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    map.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(str);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(map.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-频次编码分组\">方法二：频次编码分组</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function groupAnagrams(strs: string[]): string[][] {&#10;  const map = new Map&lt;string, string[]&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const str of strs) {&#10;    const count = new Array(26).fill(0);&#10;    for (const ch of str) {&#10;      count[ch.charCodeAt(0) - 97]++;&#10;    }&#10;    const key = count.join(&#39;#&#39;);&#10;    if (!map.has(key)) {&#10;      map.set(key, []);&#10;    }&#10;    map.get(key)!.push(str);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return Array.from(map.values());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> groupAnagrams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">strs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strs) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">26</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> str) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      count[ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">charCodeAt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 97</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">map.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      map.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    map.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(str);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(map.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>strs = [&quot;eat&quot;,&quot;tea&quot;,&quot;tan&quot;,&quot;ate&quot;,&quot;nat&quot;,&quot;bat&quot;]</code> 为例，展示排序分组的执行过程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原始字符串</th>\n<th>排序后（键）</th>\n<th>分组</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;eat&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;aet&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;eat&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;tea&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;aet&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;eat&quot;, &quot;tea&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;tan&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;ant&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;tan&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;ate&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;aet&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;eat&quot;, &quot;tea&quot;, &quot;ate&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;nat&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;ant&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;tan&quot;, &quot;nat&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;bat&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;abt&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;bat&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终 Map 的内容：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>键</th>\n<th>值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;aet&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;eat&quot;, &quot;tea&quot;, &quot;ate&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;ant&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;tan&quot;, &quot;nat&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;abt&quot;</td>\n<td>[&quot;bat&quot;]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"边界情况\">边界情况</h3><ul>\n<li>空字符串 <code>&quot;&quot;</code> 排序后仍为 <code>&quot;&quot;</code>，所有空字符串会被分到同一组</li>\n<li>单字符字符串 <code>&quot;a&quot;</code> 排序后仍为 <code>&quot;a&quot;</code>，正常处理</li>\n<li>所有字符串互为异位词时，结果为单个分组</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>排序法</th>\n<th>频次编码法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n · k log k)</td>\n<td>O(n · k)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n · k)</td>\n<td>O(n · k)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 排序法中，对 n 个字符串各执行排序操作，每次排序 O(k log k)。频次编码法中，对每个字符串统计频次 O(k)，再拼接成键 O(26) = O(1)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 两种方法都需要 O(n · k) 的空间存储哈希表中的键和值。这里 n 是字符串数量，k 是平均长度。</p>\n<p>本题是哈希映射应用的经典题目，核心思想是通过「规范化表示」将等价元素映射到同一个键。类似的思路可以推广到同构字符串（LC #205）、有效的字母异位词（LC #242）等问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 49 字母异位词分组","id":"leetcode-49-字母异位词分组"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"核心问题：如何确定分组键","id":"核心问题-如何确定分组键"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么排序法更实用","id":"为什么排序法更实用"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：排序分组","id":"方法一-排序分组"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：频次编码分组","id":"方法二-频次编码分组"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":3,"text":"边界情况","id":"边界情况"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 5 最长回文子串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0005-longest-palindromic-substring"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 151 反转字符串中的单词","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0151-reverse-words-in-string"}}